 Surbo that elevates customer engagement with surbo's conversation ai. In addition, it provides Wise Albert for digital interactions; and email, RCS business messaging, SMS, Truecaller business messaging, voice, and WhatsApp business API solutions. The company was formerly known as Tanla Solutions Limited and changed its name to Tanla Platforms Limited in October 2020. Tanla Platforms Limited was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Hyderabad, India."}}